<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Giỏ hàng - TKD Shop</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.0/css/all.min.css">

    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f8f8f8 0%, #efefef 100%);
            color: #222;
        }

        .cart-page {
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px 60px;
        }

        .cart-wrapper {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .cart-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 16px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .cart-title {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .cart-actions-top {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            min-height: 44px;
            padding: 0 18px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 999px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #ff5a3c;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            opacity: 0.92;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-dark {
            background: #222;
            color: #fff;
        }

        .btn-dark:hover {
            opacity: 0.92;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: #fff;
            color: #333;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            border-color: #ff5a3c;
            color: #ff5a3c;
        }

        .cart-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.7fr 0.75fr;
            gap: 24px;
            align-items: start;
        }

        .cart-card,
        .summary-card,
        .empty-card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 28px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
        }

        .cart-card {
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .cart-table-head {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.9fr 0.8fr 1fr 0.9fr 0.5fr;
            gap: 14px;
            padding: 18px 22px;
            background: #ff5a3c;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .cart-list {
            padding: 8px 16px 16px;
        }

        .cart-item {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.9fr 0.8fr 1fr 0.9fr 0.5fr;
            gap: 14px;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 18px 6px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #eee;
        }

        .cart-item:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }

        .product-cell {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 14px;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .product-image {
            width: 86px;
            height: 86px;
            object-fit: cover;
            border-radius: 14px;
            background: #f3f3f3;
            border: 1px solid #eee;
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .product-info {
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .product-name {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #222;
        }

        .product-meta {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #777;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .price-cell,
        .subtotal-cell {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111;
        }

        .subtotal-cell {
            color: #ff5a3c;
        }

        .qty-cell {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
        }

        .qty-form {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .qty-btn {
            width: 34px;
            height: 34px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 18px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }

        .qty-btn:hover {
            border-color: #ff5a3c;
            color: #ff5a3c;
        }

        .qty-number {
            min-width: 32px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .remove-cell {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .remove-form {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .remove-btn {
            min-width: 64px;
            min-height: 38px;
            padding: 0 14px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #ff5a3c;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: 0.2s ease;
        }

        .remove-btn:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .summary-card {
            padding: 22px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 20px;
        }

        .summary-title {
            margin: 0 0 18px;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .summary-row {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #555;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .summary-row strong {
            color: #111;
        }

        .summary-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: #e9e9e9;
            margin: 14px 0;
        }

        .summary-total {
            display: flex;
            align-items: end;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .summary-total-label {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #111;
        }

        .summary-total-value {
            font-size: 34px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ff5a3c;
        }

        .summary-note {
            margin-top: 14px;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #777;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .summary-actions {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .summary-actions .btn,
        .summary-actions form,
        .summary-actions form button {
            width: 100%;
        }

        .clear-form {
            margin: 0;
        }

        .empty-card {
            padding: 56px 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .empty-icon {
            font-size: 60px;
            color: #ff5a3c;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .empty-title {
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-size: 30px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .empty-text {
            margin: 0 0 22px;
            font-size: 15px;
            color: #666;
        }

        @media (max-width: 1000px) {
            .cart-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .summary-card {
                position: static;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 860px) {
            .cart-table-head {
                display: none;
            }

            .cart-item {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 14px;
                padding: 18px 10px;
            }

            .price-cell,
            .qty-cell,
            .subtotal-cell,
            .remove-cell {
                justify-content: space-between;
                display: flex;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .price-cell::before {
                content: "Giá";
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #666;
            }

            .qty-cell::before {
                content: "Số lượng";
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #666;
                margin-right: auto;
                padding-right: 12px;
            }

            .subtotal-cell::before {
                content: "Tạm tính";
                font-size: 14px;
                font-weight: 700;
                color: #666;
            }

            .remove-cell {
                justify-content: flex-start;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="cart-page">
    <div class="cart-wrapper">
        <%
        const cartItems = cart || [];
        let subtotal = 0;
        cartItems.forEach(item => {
            subtotal += (item.price || 0) * (item.qty || 1);
        });

        const shipping = cartItems.length > 0 ? 30000 : 0;
        const total = subtotal + shipping;

        function formatPrice(price) {
            return Number(price || 0).toLocaleString("vi-VN") + "đ";
        }
        %>

        <% if (!cartItems.length) { %>
            <div class="empty-card">
                <div class="empty-icon">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>
                </div>
                <h1 class="empty-title">Giỏ hàng đang trống</h1>
                <p class="empty-text">Hãy thêm vài mô hình yêu thích vào giỏ để tiếp tục mua sắm.</p>
                <a href="/" class="btn btn-primary">
                    <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
                    Tiếp tục mua sắm
                </a>
            </div>
        <% } else { %>
            <div class="cart-header">
                <h1 class="cart-title">Giỏ hàng</h1>

                <div class="cart-actions-top">
                    <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
                        Tiếp tục mua
                    </a>

                    <form action="/cart/clear" method="POST" class="clear-form">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-trash"></i>
                            Xóa hết
                        </button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="cart-grid">
                <div class="cart-card">
                    <div class="cart-table-head">
                        <div>Sản phẩm</div>
                        <div>Giá</div>
                        <div>Số lượng</div>
                        <div>Tạm tính</div>
                        <div></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="cart-list">
                        <% cartItems.forEach((item) => { %>
                            <div class="cart-item">
                                <div class="product-cell">
                                    <img
                                            src="<%= item.image %>"
                                            alt="<%= item.name %>"
                                            class="product-image"
                                    >

                                    <div class="product-info">
                                        <div class="product-name"><%= item.name %></div>
                                        <div class="product-meta">ID: <%= item.id %></div>
                                        <% if (item.brand) { %>
                                            <div class="product-meta">Thương hiệu: <%= item.brand %></div>
                                        <% } %>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <div class="price-cell">
                                    <%= formatPrice(item.price) %>
                                </div>

                                <div class="qty-cell">
                                    <form action="/cart/decrease/<%= item.id %>" method="POST" class="qty-form">
                                        <button type="submit" class="qty-btn">-</button>
                                    </form>

                                    <div class="qty-number"><%= item.qty || 1 %></div>

                                    <form action="/cart/increase/<%= item.id %>" method="POST" class="qty-form">
                                        <button type="submit" class="qty-btn">+</button>
                                    </form>
                                </div>

                                <div class="subtotal-cell">
                                    <%= formatPrice((item.price || 0) * (item.qty || 1)) %>
                                </div>

                                <div class="remove-cell">
                                    <form action="/cart/remove/<%= item.id %>" method="POST" class="remove-form">
                                        <button type="submit" class="remove-btn">Xóa</button>
                                    </form>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        <% }) %>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="summary-card">
                    <h2 class="summary-title">Tóm tắt đơn hàng</h2>

                    <div class="summary-row">
                        <span>Tạm tính</span>
                        <strong><%= formatPrice(subtotal) %></strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-row">
                        <span>Vận chuyển</span>
                        <strong><%= formatPrice(shipping) %></strong>
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-divider"></div>

                    <div class="summary-total">
                        <div class="summary-total-label">Tổng cộng</div>
                        <div class="summary-total-value"><%= formatPrice(total) %></div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-actions">
                        <a href="/checkout" class="btn btn-primary">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-credit-card"></i>
                            Tiến hành thanh toán
                        </a>

                        <a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">
                            <i class="fa-solid fa-bag-shopping"></i>
                            Mua thêm sản phẩm
                        </a>
                    </div>

                    <div class="summary-note">
                        Miễn phí kiểm tra thông tin đơn hàng trước khi xác nhận. Đơn sẽ được xử lý ngay sau khi bạn hoàn tất bước thanh toán.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        <% } %>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>